From a8f7fd5f33b29fe72f18447c2fca3ea2d75c4232 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:21:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/29] turnip/a5xx: multiple SSBO bindings and indirect
 dispatch

Encode the Vulkan binding as the hardware SSBO slot when lowering
vulkan_resource_index, trace the descriptor chain back to that index when
replacing bindless SSBO descriptors, and upload A5XX_SSBO state per
binding. Also emit CP_EXEC_CS_INDIRECT for indirect dispatches.

Hardware smoke test passes both direct and indirect dispatch on Adreno 509,
including a storage buffer at binding 1.

Generated-by: LLM
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu5_compute.cc | 39 +++++++++-------
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc   | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu5_compute.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu5_compute.cc
